### 1. Test Key Telemetry (Basic Route)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aquisicao

###

### 2. Test Full Metadata Environment (Advanced Route)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aquisicao/avancada

###

### 3. Force Manual Rain Storm
POST http://localhost:3000/api/controle/chuva
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "duracao": 20,
    "intensidade": "forte"
}

###

### 4. Override Irrigation Pump manually
POST http://localhost:3000/api/controle/irrigacao
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ligar": true,
    "automatico": false
}

###

### 5. Return Irrigation back to System Control Loop
POST http://localhost:3000/api/controle/irrigacao
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "automatico": true
}